<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 12.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on December 11.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			    Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p>1   Villa World	   10.00	1.10</p>
<p>2   Schroder Intl	  9.98	2.41</p>
<p>3   Prime Credit Tr	9.90	0.99</p>
<p>4   BT Prop Trust	  9.54	1.71</p>
<p>5   Prop Income Inv	9.50	1.07</p>
<p>6   Indu Property	  9.38	0.97</p>
<p>7   MT Leyshon Gold	9.19	2.72</p>
<p>8   Aust Tour		9.04	0.83</p>
<p>9   Colonial Mutual	8.81	1.18</p>
<p>10  Centro Prop	    8.71	2.24</p>
<p>11  Gandel Retail Tr     8.57	0.91</p>
<p>12  Gen Prop Tr	    8.41	2.39</p>
<p>13  Equitilink	     8.33	0.60</p>
<p>14  Schroder Prop	  8.30	2.23</p>
